Subject: [PATCH] RDKEAPPRT-762 Add reading of cert scope and secret key

This change also hard code some model properties, to start
the certification process.
---
 .../starboard/rdk/arm/configuration_public.h  |  7 +-
 src/third_party/starboard/rdk/shared/BUILD.gn |  1 +
 .../rdk/shared/system/system_get_property.cc  |  6 +-
 ...stem_sign_with_certification_secret_key.cc | 79 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/third_party/starboard/rdk/arm/configuration_public.h b/src/third_party/starboard/rdk/arm/configuration_public.h
